19:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-lg text-fg-muted leading-relaxed max-w-2xl","children":"Product pages receiving paid Meta and Google traffic fail for specific, observable reasons. Product-name H1s where the benefit should be. Price and shipping hidden until checkout. A buy button that competes with three other actions at equal weight. This guide covers each failure pattern with the signal it trips and a bounded fix."}]
